  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think having two separate launch options for VRChat, one without EAC and one with, where those who choose to use EAC will be in separate servers from those who choose not to could be a good idea. This way everyone can be happy, those who need mods for certain disabilities can use the non EAC option until the mods are added to the base game, people who like modding can continue to do so in an environment exclusively with people who are willing to play with people who mod, and those who don't like mods can continue to use EAC and not have to worry much about modders",
